      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marlin%2C_Washington",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Krupp remains Washington’s smallest incorporated town, with just 60 residents recorded in 2000.",
